stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> running: ReviewWorker lease
  running --> awaiting_publish: Report persisted
  running --> failed: Review error
  awaiting_publish --> publishing: PublishWorker lease
  publishing --> succeeded: Published or idempotent update
  publishing --> publish_failed: Retry budget exhausted
  publish_failed --> publishing: Lease recovery / retry
  failed --> [*]
  succeeded --> [*]
